{"id":"34314025","title":"明天开幕，华农等你！","published_at":"2026-10-22T17:19:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-10-22","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBpBet4W1yBgcZ1sic17cBFwzXr7zr9ffwNThsdqzHT3mFH130jgytPXMbjCCic03ibZRicPYBnqXT1ER1rT96yxb4Ajkj7VLDED2Y/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"jjilie 中国国际大学生创新大赛（2026） 广东省分赛现场决赛 将于10月23日至25日 在华南农业大学举行 400支来自全省的队伍将齐聚华农 展开激烈角","tags":["活动"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oE2DoPfzndvuIn9UUdAoiQ","paper_url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34314025","word_count":2309,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T00:22:07+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><span>jjilie</span><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBveA9dVnHeopBE869XPlQeVdmJbn8RGcNZ0ADf2tKI5uzmFmXDOff22jQekhqsvwRzPrGwwNP2qkxbcvW3pyeS68PZQqxMGnY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section><section><p><span>中国国际大学生创新大赛（2026）</span></p><p><span>广东省分赛现场决赛</span></p><p><span>将于</span><span>10月23日至25日</span></p><p><span>在华南农业大学举行</span></p><p><span>400支来自全省的队伍将齐聚华农</span></p><p><span>展开激烈角逐</span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDbGfT43c0TIzicAm50Nn7xF5YQiaqFt258rUbuIiccoXDDm20PgB1Jxg12j0gKg6ugsGjG0giaUASPwEOias0yFd3Gmuic1bwBaArOE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCYy9icAIiaQdEmNIDcN6pKKIevfSW2Ssx2VRIV9piaYejFVAe58HibRfy5d2HEhxIRSKjQOWze0jIzlFVHPsPd8WIaKQ1GZ5ibZdYw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span><span>中国国际大学生创新大赛（2026）广东省分赛作为国赛重要选拔赛，是广东省高校创新创业成果集中展示、青年创新人才同台竞技的重要平台，</span></span><span><span>在深化创新创业教育改革、赋能粤港澳大湾区创新发展中发挥重要作用</span></span><span><span>。本</span></span><span><span>届大</span></span><span><span>赛由广东省教育厅等9个部门主办，华南农业大学承办，中国建设银行</span></span><span><span>股份有限公司</span></span><span><span>广东省分行冠名支持。自今年8月启动以来，全省210所学校广泛动员、精心组织，共有11.02万个项目、42.17万人次学生报名参赛。经过层层选拔，其中400支队伍晋级现场决赛。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>赛事日程</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>本届省分赛现场决赛</span></span></p><p><span><span>赛程共3天</span></span></p><p><span><span>具体安排如下：</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAzkZz0MpR2SJPx2wjzCM2mcAyA9aHYoyhoP02AM12jxQ2Omh1xJicjIftIRMEsz88egOMfGhEpKvZzMPdTgoYbM1adZhE1KEBY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>日程安排表</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）金奖争夺赛</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025 SHO1111PPI111111111111111111111NG</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBKRKWttMLVvEsttfUGibxHcnudCddWiaSQltYREqzrzsmD7U5F0TiaiaxgicjXJS4jojOJY3DXzKqtprUKkxEicGK6DFLTf1v0pfz60/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>金奖争夺赛于</span></span><span><span>10月24日8:30-12:00、13:30-18:00</span></span><span><span>进行，设置高教主赛道、“青年红色筑梦之旅”赛道、职教赛道（含中职）、产业赛道四大赛道，共18个竞赛小组，将产生150个金奖。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>届时，各参赛队伍将携创意思路、创业项目、公益服务方案、成果转化作品和企业命题答卷齐聚赛场，在切磋中点亮创新，尽展风采。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCrEVoPKjB1jhFq7lUbOll60iaFTpJC14nr66AzAdSmUPntMzpIuaqBhopqwRzGJxQ12LG7a6ScgemcKE4iafXibaOeYBoIwhmAvI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><span>赛场分布图</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>10月23日14:30准时抽签确定各竞赛小组上场次序。各参赛团队派1名代表于14:20前，到达华南农业大学第四教学楼对应抽签室完成报到并按时参与抽签。</span></span></span></p><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAuiaQRgy43aIvVAfcCLJvUeibsfFrHkjBzPpDzib1azBrRFlYvPib0tzmPAQLQcZOU90ibWBnN1MEyAfZYEnzseAiaOOgYTib49M9iaOk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>抽签分组与抽签室对应表</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（二）冠军争夺赛暨闭幕式</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025 SHO1111PPI111111111111111111111NG</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBvfbpsgquW4Rjicgicxd8K8HdDu7VIMkR7gUxhDMLibrLhwONfpPk5b4fedhvrGOiaYbX9YpnCkTlZ99k4KYoic0bqibIzOJmb5JxBE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>冠军争夺赛于</span></span><span><span>10月25日10:00-11:00在华南农业大学综合体育馆</span></span><span><span>进行，专家组以会评的方式，从金奖争夺赛各小组排名第一的项目（主赛道本科生创意、创业组、研究生创意、创业组各一个，“青年红色筑梦之旅”赛道及职教赛道项目各一个，产业赛道不列入）遴选出6个项目参加冠军争夺赛。最终决出冠军1个、亚军2个、季军3个。若分数相同时，则名次并列，冠军、亚军、季军数量做相应调整。</span></span></p></section><p><span>当天议程包括：</span></p><ul><li><p><span><span>9:30-10:00，签到、入场</span></span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span><span>10:00-11:00，开展冠军争夺赛</span></span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span><span>11:00-12:00，闭幕式环节：观看开场节目、播放赛事回顾宣传片、领导致辞、颁奖仪式、会旗交接。</span></span></p></li></ul><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>同期活动</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>赛场之外，两场同期活动将在华农展开，既</span></span><span><span>让全省高校的创新创业成果集中亮相，也</span></span><span><span>为优质创新项目搭建对接产业的舞台。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>高校创新创业教育成果展</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>时间：</span></span></span><span><span>10月25日 8:30-12:00</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地点：</span></span></span><span><span><span>第六教学楼</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>活动简介：</span></span></span><span><span>集中展示广东省高校创新创业教育成果，供嘉宾、师生观摩、学习、交流。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>第九届粤港澳大湾区</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>大学生创新创业项目对接洽谈活动</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）启动仪式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>时间：</span></span></span><span><span>10月25日 8:30-9:30</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地点：</span></span></span><span><span><span>丁颖礼堂</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>参加人员：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）省、市相关部门负责人，各校创新创业教育工作部门负责人和有关嘉宾。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）优秀创新创业项目代表。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）投融资机构、科技企业及孵化器代表。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（二）项目对接</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>时间：</span></span></span><span><span>10月25日 9:30-12:00</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地点：</span></span></span><span><span><span>丁颖礼堂、第六教学楼</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>参加人员：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）优秀创新创业项目代表。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）投融资机构、科技企业及孵化器代表。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><span><span>活动简介：</span></span></span><span><span>活动将邀请大学生优质创新创业项目、粤港澳大湾区企事业单位共同参与，采取项目展示、路演及洽谈的方式进行，为大湾区大学生优质项目赋能，助力优秀项目在大湾区孵化落地。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>国创赛，华农准备好了！</span></strong></p></se